sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Trigger as CLI / Scheduler
    participant Orch as RunOrchestrator
    participant Policy as PolicyGate
    participant Conn as ElInformativoConnector
    participant HTTP as ResponsibleHttpClient
    participant Site as Fuente remota
    participant UoW as UnitOfWork / DB
    participant Blob as LocalBlobStore
    participant Extract as ExtractionRouter
    participant Facts as FactValidator
    participant Obs as RunReporter

    Trigger->>Orch: run(source_code, correlation_id)
    Orch->>UoW: begin_run(correlation_id)
    UoW-->>Orch: crawl_run existente o nuevo
    Orch->>Policy: evaluate(base_url, user_agent)
    Policy->>HTTP: fetch robots.txt con cache
    HTTP->>Site: GET condicional
    Site-->>HTTP: 200 o 304
    HTTP-->>Policy: PolicySnapshot
    Policy-->>Orch: allowed + crawl_delay

    Orch->>Conn: discover(run_context)
    Conn->>HTTP: fetch pagina indice
    HTTP->>Site: GET con User-Agent y rate limit
    Site-->>HTTP: HTML
    HTTP-->>Conn: FetchResult + cache metadata
    Conn-->>Orch: publicaciones y documentos canonicos

    loop Cada publicacion descubierta
        Orch->>UoW: upsert_publication(source, canonical_url)
        Orch->>UoW: upsert_publication_version(content_sha256)
    end

    loop Cada documento descubierto
        Orch->>HTTP: stream(document_url)
        HTTP->>Site: GET condicional y limitado
        Site-->>HTTP: bytes del PDF
        HTTP-->>Orch: stream + metadatos
        Orch->>Blob: put_if_absent(stream, sha256)
        Blob-->>Orch: StoredBlob existente o nuevo
        Orch->>UoW: register_document_version(document_id, sha256)
        UoW-->>Orch: version existente o nueva

        alt Extraccion ya registrada para el fingerprint
            Orch->>UoW: load_extraction(input_fingerprint)
            UoW-->>Orch: resultado reutilizado
        else Version nueva o extractor actualizado
            Orch->>Extract: extract(document_version)
            Extract-->>Orch: fact_candidates con pagina, bbox y snippet
            Orch->>Facts: validate_and_score(candidates)
            Facts-->>Orch: validated_facts
            Orch->>UoW: persist facts + evidence + review flags
            UoW-->>Orch: commit atomico con upserts
        end
    end

    Orch->>Obs: finalize(crawl_run_id, counters)
    Obs->>UoW: save run_report + checkpoint
    UoW-->>Obs: committed
    Obs-->>Orch: RunReport
    Orch-->>Trigger: completed o completed_with_reviews

    Note over UoW,Blob: Repetir la corrida reutiliza correlation keys, hashes y fingerprints; no duplica filas ni archivos.
